<h1>Task Management System — Short Guide</h1>
<p class="meta">Project: TaskManagement &nbsp;|&nbsp; Port: 6065 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Document Type: Quick Reference (Short Details)</p>

<h2>1. Project Overview</h2>
<div class="box">
Internal web app for eProcurement task/ticket tracking: users, tasks, dashboard, Excel import/export, audit trail, and email notifications.<br/>
<strong>Tech:</strong> Java 17, Spring Boot, Spring Security, JPA, Thymeleaf, SQL Server, Apache POI, JavaMail.
</div>

<h2>2. How to Start</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Run Spring Boot app (server port <strong>6065</strong>)</li>
  <li>Open <strong>http://localhost:6065/login</strong></li>
  <li>Default seed admin (if used): <strong>admin@localmail.com</strong> / <strong>123</strong></li>
</ul>

<h2>3. User Roles (Short)</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Role</th><th>Access (short)</th></tr>
  <tr><td>ADMIN</td><td>Full access: users, tasks, delete, audit, mail reports, deleted tasks, Excel export</td></tr>
  <tr><td>SR_DEVELOPER</td><td>Same admin features as ADMIN for ops (users/audit/mail/deleted/export/delete)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>SUPPORT</td><td>Admin menus (users/audit/mail/deleted); can edit all tasks; delete via API allowed</td></tr>
  <tr><td>DEVELOPER</td><td>Dashboard, My Task, Add/Manage Task; edit own/unassigned only; no admin menus</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>4. Login & Session (Short)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Login:</strong> email + password → Spring Security → load user → fill session → go Dashboard</li>
  <li><strong>Session:</strong> 30 minutes timeout; max 1 session per user</li>
  <li><strong>Logout:</strong> clears session, writes logout audit (if Audit Entry ON)</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Main Modules (Short)</h2>

<h3>5.1 Dashboard</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Shows filtered task tickets (client, assignee, priority, status, dates, etc.)</li>
  <li>KPI cards for status counts</li>
  <li>Edit / Delete actions based on role</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.2 Task Management</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Add / Edit / Manage / My Task</strong></li>
  <li>Soft delete = <code>isActive = 0</code></li>
  <li><strong>Deleted Task</strong> page lists inactive tasks; <strong>Rollback</strong> sets <code>isActive = 1</code></li>
  <li>Key fields: Assigned To, Priority, Paid, Client, Redmine ID, Issue, Requirement, Task Details, Remarks, Status, Fixed On, Days</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.3 User Management</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Create / Edit / Delete users; toggle Active; Change Password</li>
  <li>Roles assignable: Developer, Sr. Developer, Support</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.4 Excel</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Upload Excel to create tasks in bulk</li>
  <li>Export active tasks to Excel</li>
  <li>Download template available</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.5 Audit Report</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Shows LOGIN/LOGOUT/CREATE/UPDATE/DELETE and related actions</li>
  <li>Filters: Username, Action, Entity, Description, IP, Date range</li>
  <li>Controlled by <strong>Audit Entry ON/OFF</strong></li>
</ul>

<h3>5.6 Email Audit Report</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Shows all mail logs (to, cc, subject, status, error, times)</li>
  <li>Toggles: <strong>Mail Send</strong>, <strong>Mail CC</strong>, <strong>Audit Entry</strong></li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Email Notifications (Short)</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Event</th><th>Template</th><th>To</th></tr>
  <tr><td>User created</td><td>USER_REGISTERED</td><td>New user email</td></tr>
  <tr><td>User updated</td><td>USER_UPDATED</td><td>User email</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Task created</td><td>TASK_CREATED</td><td>Assigned user</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Task updated (changes)</td><td>TASK_UPDATED</td><td>Assigned user</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Task deleted</td><td>TASK_DELETED</td><td>Assigned user</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>CC:</strong> from <code>mail.notification.cc</code> when Mail CC is ON.<br/>
<strong>Mail Send OFF:</strong> no email is sent.<br/>
<strong>Mail CC OFF:</strong> email goes To only (no CC).</p>

<h2>7. Important URLs (Short)</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>URL</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td>/login</td><td>Login page</td></tr>
  <tr><td>/dashboard</td><td>Home / tickets</td></tr>
  <tr><td>/tasks</td><td>Manage tasks</td></tr>
  <tr><td>/tasks/myTask</td><td>My tasks</td></tr>
  <tr><td>/tasks/taskForm</td><td>Add task</td></tr>
  <tr><td>/tasks/deleted</td><td>Deleted tasks + Rollback</td></tr>
  <tr><td>/users</td><td>Manage users</td></tr>
  <tr><td>/audit/report</td><td>Audit Report</td></tr>
  <tr><td>/mail/report</td><td>Email Audit Report + toggles</td></tr>
  <tr><td>/excel/export-tasks</td><td>Export Excel</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>8. Main Database Tables (Short)</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Table</th><th>Stores</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Tbl_UserLogin</td><td>Users / roles / passwords</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tbl_tasks</td><td>Tasks (soft delete via isActive)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tbl_audit</td><td>Audit entries</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tbl_mail_log</td><td>Email send history</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tbl_mail_template</td><td>Email templates</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tbl_mail_setting</td><td>Mail Send / Mail CC / Audit Entry switches</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>9. Runtime Switches (Short)</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Switch</th><th>ON</th><th>OFF</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Mail Send</td><td>Send emails</td><td>Do not send emails</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Mail CC</td><td>Add CC recipients</td><td>To only</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Audit Entry</td><td>Insert audit rows</td><td>Skip audit inserts</td></tr>
</table>

<p class="meta">End of Short Guide — See companion document: <strong>TaskManagement_HowToWork_Detailed.doc</strong> for full process descriptions.</p>

</body>
</html>
